  abstract = {Virtual technology presents us with opportunities in the interactive learning ecosystems. Accordingly, the three factors of the learning ecosystem have expanded new channels, and immersive learning appears to be a commonly discussed method under the metaverse layout. From the perspective of digital narrative, this paper explores the impact of online immersive learning on the construction of a virtual interactive learning ecosystem, along with the challenges it brings to the learning process. The main method includes case studies and phased framework extension based on previous work (Liu, Ricco \& Calabi, 2021b; Liu, Su, Nie \& Song, 2022). As an output, we link the frame of four immersive typologies with several researchers’ work to give advice to the fields of application, teaching models and narrative tools.},
